{
  "info": {
    "name": "TaskFlow API v2 (base)",
    "description": "Coleccion BASE para el Integrador S2D5 (SIN auth todavia). En el integrador vas a: (1) crear una variable de coleccion {{token}}; (2) poner auth tipo Bearer {{token}} a NIVEL COLECCION (asi todos los requests la heredan); (3) en el request Login, anadir un script post-response que guarde el token: pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", pm.response.json().token). Con eso, un login autentica toda la coleccion. Variables: {{baseUrl}} = http://localhost:8080.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Registro y login. Estos endpoints son PUBLICOS (permitAll) y no llevan token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST Register (201)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"demo\",\n  \"email\": \"demo@taskflow.dev\",\n  \"password\": \"demo123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Alta de usuario. 201 con UserResponse (SIN passwordHash). Username duplicado -> 409."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"ana\",\n  \"password\": \"ana123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login. 200 con { token }. TODO integrador: en la pestana 'Scripts/Tests' de ESTE request, anade: pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", pm.response.json().token); para guardar el token. Usuarios: ana/ana123 (USER, owner del proyecto 1), luis/luis123 (USER), admin/admin123 (ADMIN)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Projects",
      "description": "CRUD de proyectos. TODO integrador: una vez montada la auth Bearer {{token}} a nivel coleccion, estos requests la heredan.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Projects",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/projects",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["projects"]
            },
            "description": "Todos los proyectos. Sin token -> 401; con token -> 200."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Project (201)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Proyecto de la demo\",\n  \"description\": \"Creado en la demo final\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/projects",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["projects"]
            },
            "description": "Crea un proyecto. 201 + Location. El owner se toma del usuario del JWT (no viaja en el cuerpo)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE Project (204 owner/ADMIN | 403 otro)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/1",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["projects", "1"]
            },
            "description": "Solo ADMIN o el owner. Con ana (owner del 1) o admin -> 204; con luis -> 403; sin token -> 401."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Tasks de un proyecto",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/1/tasks",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["projects", "1", "tasks"]
            },
            "description": "Tareas de un proyecto (TaskResponse)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Task bajo proyecto (201)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Tarea de la demo\",\n  \"description\": \"Con assignee para poder completarla\",\n  \"priority\": \"HIGH\",\n  \"assigneeId\": 1,\n  \"dueDate\": \"2099-12-31\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/1/tasks",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["projects", "1", "tasks"]
            },
            "description": "Crea una tarea bajo el proyecto 1. 201 + Location: /tasks/{id}. Nace en TODO."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tasks",
      "description": "CRUD de tareas.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Tasks",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tasks",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["tasks"]
            },
            "description": "Todas las tareas, ordenadas por urgencia."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH Task status DONE (200)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"DONE\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/tasks/1/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["tasks", "1", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Cambia el estado. Con assignee -> 200; a DONE sin assignee (/tasks/6/status) -> 422."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
